# PUBLIC scaffolding repository. Intentionally allowlist everything.
# Real V6/V7 runtime config, archives and credentials must stay private.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!.github/
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/quality.yml
!.github/pull_request_template.md
!docs/
!docs/STROJ_V7_WORKFLOW.md
!tests/
!tests/test_repository_policy.py
!datadog/
datadog/*
!datadog/compose.yaml
!datadog/README.md
!datadog/.env.example
# Defense in depth, even if subdirectories are later allowed.
**/.env
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*secret*
**/*token*
**/backups/**
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.zfo
**/*.eml
**/*.jsonl
**/*.log
